"Advertises spatial audio playback for FaceTime. Availability depends on the device and call." = "声明 FaceTime 空间音频播放支持，实际可用性取决于设备与通话。";
"Advertises the internal Settings bundle. May affect system services and does not install missing internal components." = "声明内部设置面板支持，可能影响系统服务，不会安装缺少的内部组件。";
"First, this will temporarily spoof an eligible device. Face ID and dictation may stop working while spoofed. Complete the Siri AI model download in Settings, then open Restore and use “After Model Download · Remove Device Spoof”. This restores your original device identity while keeping AI settings. A separate full backup is also saved before setup. System instability is possible." = "将先临时伪装为支持的机型，期间面容 ID 和听写可能失效。请先在设置中完成 Siri AI 模型下载，再到“恢复”使用“模型下载后 · 撤销机型伪装”。它会恢复原设备身份，并保留 AI 配置。开启前还会按原方式保存一份完整备份。此过程可能导致系统不稳定。";
"After Model Download · Remove Device Spoof" = "模型下载后 · 撤销机型伪装";
"After the Siri AI model download finishes, use this backup to remove device spoofing while keeping Siri AI settings." = "完成 Siri AI 模型下载后，使用此备份撤销机型伪装并保留 Siri AI 配置。";
"Remove Device Spoof?" = "撤销机型伪装？";
"Remove Device Spoof" = "撤销伪装";
"Complete the Siri AI model download first. Only your original device identity will be restored; SiriMode and other AI settings stay enabled. The current file will be backed up before writing." = "请先完成 Siri AI 模型下载。此操作只恢复原设备身份，保留 SiriMode 和其他 AI 配置。写入前会备份当前文件。";
"This Siri AI identity backup belongs to a different device." = "这份 Siri AI 身份恢复备份属于另一台设备。";
"This device is already spoofed, but no original identity backup was found. Restore an original MobileGestalt backup before starting Siri AI setup again." = "设备已处于伪装状态，但未找到原设备身份备份。请先恢复原始 MobileGestalt 备份，再重新开启 Siri AI。";
"First, this will temporarily spoof an eligible device. Face ID and dictation may stop working while spoofed. Complete the Siri AI model download in Settings, then open Restore and use “After Model Download · Remove Device Spoof”. After removing the spoof and restarting, Face ID and dictation will work again while Siri AI settings stay enabled. A separate full backup is also saved before setup. System instability is possible." = "将先临时伪装为支持的机型，期间面容 ID 和听写可能失效。请先在设置中完成 Siri AI 模型下载，再到“恢复”使用“模型下载后 · 撤销机型伪装”。撤销伪装并重启后，面容 ID 和听写会恢复，Siri AI 配置会保留。开启前还会按原方式保存一份完整备份。此过程可能导致系统不稳定。";
"After the Siri AI model download finishes, use this backup to remove device spoofing. Face ID and dictation will work again after restarting, while Siri AI settings stay enabled." = "完成 Siri AI 模型下载后，使用此备份撤销机型伪装。重启后面容 ID 和听写会恢复，Siri AI 配置会保留。";
"Complete the Siri AI model download first. Your original device identity will be restored, and Face ID and dictation will work again after restarting. SiriMode and other AI settings stay enabled. The current file will be backed up before writing." = "请先完成 Siri AI 模型下载。此操作会恢复原设备身份，重启后面容 ID 和听写会恢复。SiriMode 和其他 AI 配置会保留。写入前会备份当前文件。";
